1. LinkedIn Scholars & Specialized Programs
LinkedIn runs targeted academic initiatives, such as LinkedIn Scholars, designed to bridge university talent with real-world engineering problem-solving. This program exposes high-performing tech students to industrial scale systems, data science modeling, and engineering mentorship. Successfully participating in these structured formats puts your profile on the high-priority radar of specialized tech recruiters.


2. Off-Campus Application Timeline (The Hiring Window)
